### Skill chip distribution: crates, boxes and the uplink category.

store-category-skills = Skills

uplink-skill-chip-bundle-name = Combat Skill Chip Crate
uplink-skill-chip-bundle-desc = Eight assorted combat skill chips, pulled from a landfill and resterilised. Enough to make a raid squad competent.

uplink-skill-chip-weapons-unarmed-name = APTR-Chip (Unarmed)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-unarmed-desc = Teaches your hands to hit properly.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-bludgeon-name = APTR-Chip (Bludgeon)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-bludgeon-desc = Teaches you which end of a baton to hold.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-knife-name = APTR-Chip (Short Blade)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-knife-desc = Teaches you to use a knife on something other than bread.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-sword-name = APTR-Chip (Long Blade)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-sword-desc = Teaches you to swing a sword without dropping it.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-polearm-name = APTR-Chip (Polearm)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-polearm-desc = Teaches you to keep the pointy end away from yourself.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-non-lethal-name = APTR-Chip (Non-Lethal)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-non-lethal-desc = Teaches you to disable rather than kill.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-tool-name = APTR-Chip (Combat Tools)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-tool-desc = Teaches you that a wrench is a weapon in the right hands.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-energy-name = APTR-Chip (Energy Weapons)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-energy-desc = Teaches you to handle energy melee weaponry.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-smg-name = APTR-Chip (SMG)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-smg-desc = Teaches you to control a submachine gun's recoil.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-pistol-name = APTR-Chip (Pistol)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-pistol-desc = Teaches you to shoot a sidearm straight.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-rifle-name = APTR-Chip (Longarms)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-rifle-desc = Teaches you to shoulder a rifle properly.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-shotgun-name = APTR-Chip (Shotgun)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-shotgun-desc = Teaches you to brace against a shotgun's kick.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-sniper-name = APTR-Chip (Sniper)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-sniper-desc = Teaches you to hold your breath and squeeze.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-laser-name = APTR-Chip (Laser)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-laser-desc = Teaches you to lead a target with a laser carbine.
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-heavy-name = APTR-Chip (Heavy Weapons)
uplink-skill-chip-weapons-heavy-desc = Teaches you to carry and aim something far too large.

